{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>What is the White Room Protocol?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jesse volunteered to forget his trauma. Not because he is weak \u2014 but because the memory is stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In White Room Protocol, you step into the mind of a subject undergoing an experimental memory-erasure program. Starting from a sterile white room, you\u2019re guided into Jesse\u2019s most haunting memory \u2014 his childhood home \u2014 where something terrible happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is not just a horror game. It\u2019s a psychological descent into a place you once thought was safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Psychological horror with immersive atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Flashlight-based exploration with dynamic lighting and atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spine-chilling sound design and environmental storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Light puzzle-solving integrated into the narrative</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Realistic first-person interactions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready to erase the past \u2014 or will the past erase you?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3648450?t=1747574945","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3648450?t=1747574945","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648450/2cf465847ee773db879a4463823d1d30ed3e009e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747574945","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648450/2cf465847ee773db879a4463823d1d30ed3e009e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747574945","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains scenes of psychological distress, mental trauma, and intense fear. The narrative includes references to domestic violence and the aftermath of a murder within a family setting. There are no depictions of sexual content or drug use.\r\n\r\nPlayer discretion is advised due to scenes of emotional manipulation, self-blame, and unsettling hallucinations.\r\n"},"demos":[{"appid":3709450,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>What is the White Room Protocol?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jesse volunteered to forget his trauma. Not because he is weak \u2014 but because the memory is stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In White Room Protocol, you step into the mind of a subject undergoing an experimental memory-erasure program. Starting from a sterile white room, you\u2019re guided into Jesse\u2019s most haunting memory \u2014 his childhood home \u2014 where something terrible happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is not just a horror game. It\u2019s a psychological descent into a place you once thought was safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Psychological horror with immersive atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Flashlight-based exploration with dynamic lighting and atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spine-chilling sound design and environmental storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Light puzzle-solving integrated into the narrative</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Realistic first-person interactions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready to erase the past \u2014 or will the past erase you?</p>","developers":["Lefto Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simu